+| `git ls-remote git@github.com:coding-hermes/code-factory.git refs/heads/main` (plain) | 6 | 1 × rc=0 success, 1 × rc=128 `Permission denied (publickey)`, 4 × rc=124 (hung, cut by `timeout`) |
